OL,3,AWhy Canada is preparing for a (long
OL,4,Ashot) US invasion
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Mark Carney admitted
OL,7,Flast week that he has prepared for a
OL,8,Fonce-unthinkable scenario - a US
OL,9,Finvasion.
OL,11,FNoting the risk was low and the
OL,12,Flikelihood highly improbable, he told
OL,13,Fthe New York Times he had a
OL,14,Fresponsibility to consider all
OL,15,Fpossibilities as the US-Canada
OL,16,Frelationship is redefined under the
OL,17,FDonald Trump presidency.
OL,19,F"That's just risk management," Carney
OL,20,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
