OL,3,AWhy Canada is preparing for a (long
OL,4,Ashot) US invasion
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrump's global tariffs and his
OL,7,Foften-repeated desire to make Canada
OL,8,Fthe 51st state has led Canada to war
OL,9,Fgame an attack by the Americans.
